WLOC

This distribution is based on xiaobovlog/WLOC:
https://github.com/xiaobovlog/WLOC

The upstream source is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original license and source attribution are retained in this distribution.

This distribution adds place search, an independent location favorites tab,
map/search/coordinate entry, editable names, saved accuracy, explicit location
application, automated tests, and privacy checks for public releases.
Modified upstream files carry modification notices. Personal IDE state and
local development history are not part of this public source snapshot.

